{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux经Telnet连接内网。对应需求：安全检测。官方：Connection to Internal Network via Telnet。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.network*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux经Telnet连接内网","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux经Telnet连接内网\n\n### 为何重要\n可能表示异常活动\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://www.iana.org/assignments/iana-ipv4-special-registry/iana-ipv4-special-registry.xhtml"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"1b21abcc-4d9f-4b08-a7f5-316f5f94b973","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 安全检测","来源: 默认","对应需求: 安全检测"],"type":"eql","query":"sequence by process.entity_id\n  [process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action in (\"exec\", \"start\") and process.name == \"telnet\"]\n  [network where host.os.type == \"linux\" and process.name == \"telnet\" and cidrmatch(\n     destination.ip, \"10.0.0.0/8\", \"127.0.0.0/8\", \"169.254.0.0/16\", \"172.16.0.0/12\", \"192.0.0.0/24\", \"192.0.0.0/29\",\n     \"192.0.0.8/32\", \"192.0.0.9/32\", \"192.0.0.10/32\", \"192.0.0.170/32\", \"192.0.0.171/32\", \"192.0.2.0/24\",\n     \"192.31.196.0/24\", \"192.52.193.0/24\", \"192.168.0.0/16\", \"192.88.99.0/24\", \"224.0.0.0/4\", \"100.64.0.0/10\",\n     \"192.175.48.0/24\", \"198.18.0.0/15\", \"198.51.100.0/24\", \"203.0.113.0/24\", \"240.0.0.0/4\", \"::1\", \"FE80::/10\",\n     \"FF00::/8\"\n    )\n  ]\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral 